<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><FinalDraft DocumentType="Script" Template="No" Version="3"><Content><Paragraph Number="1" Type="Scene Heading"><Text>LOR. LOREM IPSUM DOLOR - ELIT </Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>LOREM ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Quisque quis nulla eu mi euismod vestibulum. IPSUM ante sem, vehicula id ultrices vitae, laoreet id ligula.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Curabitur luctus leo sed quam venenatis. DOLOR tellus dui, accumsan eu nibh id, lobortis sodales orci.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>LOREM</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Sed rhoncus convallis mollis.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>IPSUM</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Parenthetical"><Text>(aliquam erat)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Quisque consectetur felis eu nibh facilisis, quis lacinia nisi semper.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>LOREM</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Suspendisse eget eros eu lacus faucibus hendrerit eu eget felis. Maecenas faucibus orci sed tincidunt consequat.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>DOLOR aenean convallis sollicitudin libero at rutrum. Fusce ut massa auctor, tempus tellus in, viverra nisl.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>DOLOR</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Parenthetical"><Text>(vivamus dignissim)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Mauris.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>IPSUM</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Eget sapien nunc ?</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>DOLOR</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Quisque ultricies vehicula augue, sit amet tincidunt mi pretium vitae. Etiam auctor ultricies elit a interdum.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Parenthetical"><Text>(vestibulum convallis)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Magna a purus auctor porta.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>LOREM vel consectetur arcu. IPSUM porttitor risus.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Number="2" Type="Scene Heading"><Text>IPS. SIT AMET CONSECTETUR - AMET </Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Aenean tortor lectus, tincidunt eu malesuada quis, venenatis non odio. SIT AMET ultricies eget neque a pulvinar. Vestibulum ultricies vulputate mi. Duis lectus nisl, feugiat at pretium eu, euismod in neque. Vivamus feugiat felis enim, non dignissim elit egestas blandit.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Maecenas faucibus ornare mi. CONSECTETUR id nisi dolor. Nulla malesuada turpis turpis.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Ut nec rutrum nulla.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Quisque interdum, metus vitae luctus vestibulum, SIT AMET nunc consectetur turpis, ut suscipit magna dui eget odio. Nullam ac aliquam enim. CONSECTETUR luctus commodo felis.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Number="3" Type="Scene Heading"><Text>LOR. ADIPISCING - ELIT </Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Interdum et malesuada fames ac ante ipsum primis in faucibus. ELIT sagittis interdum, LOREM eros.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>ELIT</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Praesent sagittis interdum eros.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>LOREM</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Aenean consequat rhoncus eros, a suscipit orci.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>ELIT</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Nunc non gravida dolor ?</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>LOREM</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Ut interdum.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>ELIT</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Odio.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>LOREM</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Parenthetical"><Text>(vivamus eleifend)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Nec enim in vehicula.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>SIT AMET sed condimentum auctor erat. Sed elementum.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>SIT AMET</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Quisque non arcu sed augue posuere consectetur. Vestibulum porta massa id massa pulvinar varius. Etiam lacinia rhoncus quam eget luctus. Proin ac ornare orci. Curabitur eleifend commodo mi, non suscipit urna laoreet eu. Aenean a sapien non tortor dictum laoreet aliquet quis ipsum. Class aptent taciti sociosqu ad litora torquent per conubia nostra, per inceptos himenaeos.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>ELIT</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Parenthetical"><Text>(aliquam dapibus)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Est quis sem posuere congue.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>LOREM et ELIT cras et venenatis augue.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Number="4" Type="Scene Heading"><Text>LOR./IPS. INTEGER A ORCI FAUCIBUS PORTTITOR SAPIEN NEC EUISMOD - DOLOR VESTIBULUM PORTTITOR - VELIT </Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Mauris nisl justo, posuere a auctor vel, vulputate id diam. DOLOR nec dignissim ipsum.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Proin posuere, libero vitae dictum dignissim, est tellus semper enim, id pulvinar eros erat vel nulla. Suspendisse potenti.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Nunc enim arcu, dictum et tellus nec, venenatis vestibulum turpis.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Vivamus scelerisque nulla vitae mauris congue ultricies. DOLOR dignissim ex sed elit bibendum, sit amet maximus elit ullamcorper. Cras mattis scelerisque metus a pretium. Ut aliquet non enim fringilla mattis. Cras tincidunt ex nec mattis facilisis.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>DOLOR</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Parenthetical"><Text>(praesent tempor)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Enim at mi auctor ?</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>DOLOR in rutrum erat bibendum.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Number="5" Type="Scene Heading"><Text>IPS. ALIQUAM ODIO - ELIT </Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Elementum at IPSUM eget, condimentum condimentum purus. CONSECTETUR vel diam efficitur, placerat tortor vel. ADIPISCING et VULPUTATE volutpat velit.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>CONSECTETUR</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Nulla fermentum risus ultrices finibus malesuada.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>ADIPISCING</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Nulla magna nisl, tincidunt vitae orci id, hendrerit elementum eros.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>VULPUTATE</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Parenthetical"><Text>(phasellus ac maximus)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Massa, in mattis augue.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>IPSUM</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Fames ac ante ipsum primis in faucibus. Donec pellentesque, lectus sit amet dictum ullamcorper, sapien lacus dapibus sapien, nec pellentesque nunc nisi id augue.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>CONSECTETUR nunc vel risus commodo. ADIPISCING viverra.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>CONSECTETUR</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Mauris ac nisi at lectus.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>ADIPISCING</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Ultrices ?</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>CONSECTETUR</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Parenthetical"><Text>(tempor)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Ultrices.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>VULPUTATE</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Pellentesque habitant morbi tristique senectus et netus et malesuada fames ac turpis egestas. Morbi a lacus id justo faucibus semper.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Parenthetical"><Text>(nam sed)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Erat vitae nunc ornare tincidunt.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Parenthetical"><Text>(sed et)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Eros.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>IPSUM, CONSECTETUR et ADIPISCING donec eget nisl.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Number="6" Type="Scene Heading"><Text>LOR. NAM SED ERAT - AMET </Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>LOREM in hac habitasse platea dictumst. Duis aliquet egestas purus in blandit.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>IPSUM curabitur vulputate, ligula lacinia scelerisque tempor, lacus lacus ornare ante, ac egestas est urna sit amet arcu. Class aptent taciti sociosqu ad litora torquent per conubia nostra.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>LOREM</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Sed molestie augue sit amet leo consequat posuere.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>IPSUM</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Vestibulum ante ipsum primis in faucibus orci luctus et ultrices posuere cubilia curae ; proin vel ante a orci tempus eleifend ut et magna.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>LOREM</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Vivamus luctus urna sed urna ultricies ac tempor dui sagittis. In condimentum facilisis porta. Sed nec diam eu diam mattis viverra. Nulla fringilla, orci ac euismod semper, magna diam porttitor mauris, quis sollicitudin sapien justo in libero. Vestibulum mollis mauris enim. Morbi euismod magna ac lorem rutrum elementum. Donec viverra auctor lobortis. Pellentesque eu est a nulla placerat dignissim.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>IPSUM morbi luctus.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>LOREM</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Parenthetical"><Text>(mauris)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Et odio ut ligula.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Number="7" Type="Scene Heading"><Text>IPS. CURABITUR - ELIT </Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>DOLOR pharetra dignissim. Nunc tincidunt.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>SIT AMET integer volutpat, libero quis tempus.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>DOLOR proin.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Number="8" Type="Scene Heading"><Text>LOR. VESTIBULUM ELEMENTUM SEMPER - FELIS VITAE - AMET </Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Duis quis ante a nisi ultrices faucibus. ELIT erat volutpat. Mauris consequat nisi a turpis. ADIPISCING nec urna. Phasellus ac felis ut erat dignissim aliquam. Nulla facilisi. DOLOR egestas, nisl eu ultrices pharetra, risus nisl sagittis lorem, ut condimentum eros purus in mauris.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Proin tempus, CONSECTETUR vitae hendrerit placerat, risus enim suscipit nibh. SIT AMET accumsan nisl erat in lectus. Duis vel VULPUTATE.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>ELIT</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Quisque nec tortor at nibh viverra tristique.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>DOLOR</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Fusce dignissim.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>SIT AMET</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Parenthetical"><Text>(nunc lacinia)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Placerat enim.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>VULPUTATE</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Sed blandit sem a nisl. Aenean ultrices, est vitae lobortis feugiat.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>ELIT</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Urna.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>ADIPISCING integer cursus sagittis nibh. CONSECTETUR varius rhoncus, magna lacus fermentum lacus.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>ADIPISCING</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Suspendisse nisl elit, rhoncus eget, elementum ac, condimentum eget, diam. Nam at tortor in tellus interdum sagittis. Aliquam lobortis. Donec orci lectus, aliquam ut, faucibus non, euismod id, nulla. Curabitur blandit mollis lacus. Nam adipiscing. Vestibulum eu odio.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>CONSECTETUR</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Parenthetical"><Text>(vivamus laoreet)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Nullam tincidunt adipiscing enim.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>DOLOR</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Phasellus tempus.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>CONSECTETUR</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Proin viverra, ligula sit amet ultrices semper, ligula arcu tristique sapien, a accumsan nisi mauris ac eros.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>ELIT, DOLOR et SIT AMET fusce neque. VULPUTATE etiam posuere.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>ELIT</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Parenthetical"><Text>(quisque libero)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Metus, condimentum nec, tempor a, commodo mollis, magna.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Number="9" Type="Scene Heading"><Text>LOR. VARIUS TINCIDUNT - VELIT </Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Phasellus dolor. IPSUM vestibulum mollis diam. Pellentesque ut neque. Pellentesque habitant morbi tristique senectus et netus et malesuada fames ac turpis egestas.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>In dui magna, posuere eget, vestibulum et, tempor auctor, justo. In ac felis quis tortor malesuada pretium. Pellentesque auctor neque nec urna. IPSUM sapien, porta a, auctor quis, euismod ut, mi.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Aenean viverra rhoncus pede.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Pellentesque habitant morbi tristique senectus et netus et malesuada fames ac turpis egestas. Ut non enim eleifend felis pretium feugiat. Vivamus quis mi. Phasellus a est. Phasellus magna. In hac habitasse platea dictumst. Curabitur at lacus ac velit ornare lobortis.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Curabitur a felis in nunc fringilla tristique. IPSUM mattis ullamcorper velit.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>IPSUM</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Parenthetical"><Text>(phasellus gravida)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Semper nisi.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Number="10" Type="Scene Heading"><Text>IPS. NULLAM VEL SEM PELLENTESQUE LIBERO TORTOR TINCIDUNT ET SEMPER NEC QUAM - SED HENDRERIT MORBI AC FELIS - ELIT </Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>At malesuada velit leo quis pede. LOREM interdum, metus et hendrerit aliquet, dolor diam sagittis ligula. VULPUTATE egestas libero turpis vel mi.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>VULPUTATE</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Nunc nulla.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>LOREM</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Fusce risus nisl, viverra et, tempor et, pretium in, sapien.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>VULPUTATE</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Donec venenatis vulputate lorem.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>LOREM</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Morbi nec metus.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>VULPUTATE</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Phasellus blandit leo ut odio.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>LOREM</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Parenthetical"><Text>(maecenas ullamcorper)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Dui et placerat feugiat, eros pede varius nisi, condimentum viverra felis nunc et lorem.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>VULPUTATE sed magna purus, fermentum eu, tincidunt eu, varius ut, felis.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>VULPUTATE</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>In auctor lobortis lacus. Quisque libero metus, condimentum nec, tempor a, commodo mollis, magna. Vestibulum ullamcorper mauris at ligula. Fusce fermentum. Nullam cursus lacinia erat. Praesent blandit laoreet nibh. Fusce convallis metus id felis luctus adipiscing. Pellentesque egestas, neque sit amet convallis pulvinar, justo nulla eleifend augue, ac auctor orci leo non est. Quisque id mi. Ut tincidunt tincidunt erat.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Parenthetical"><Text>(etiam feugiat)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Lorem non metus.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Parenthetical"><Text>(vestibulum dapibus nunc ac augue)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Curabitur vestibulum aliquam leo.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>LOREM</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Praesent egestas neque eu enim.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Number="11" Type="Scene Heading"><Text>LOR. HABITASSE - AMET </Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Nam commodo suscipit quam. ADIPISCING id odio, ELIT venenatis.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>ADIPISCING</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Praesent venenatis metus at tortor pulvinar varius.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>ELIT lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetuer adipiscing elit.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>ELIT</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Donec quam felis, ultricies nec, pellentesque eu, pretium quis, sem.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>ADIPISCING</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Nulla consequat massa quis enim.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>ADIPISCING donec pede justo, fringilla vel, aliquet nec, vulputate eget, arcu.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>ELIT in enim justo, rhoncus ut, imperdiet a, venenatis vitae, justo.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>ELIT</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Parenthetical"><Text>(nullam dictum)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Felis eu pede mollis pretium.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>ADIPISCING</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Integer tincidunt.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Number="12" Type="Scene Heading"><Text>LOR./IPS. CRAS DAPIBUS - ELIT </Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Aenean vulputate eleifend tellus. SIT AMET leo ligula, porttitor eu, consequat vitae, eleifend ac, enim. CONSECTETUR lorem ante, dapibus in, viverra quis, feugiat a, tellus.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Phasellus viverra nulla ut metus varius laoreet. IPSUM rutrum.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>SIT AMET</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Aenean imperdiet.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>CONSECTETUR</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Etiam ultricies nisi vel augue.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>IPSUM</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Parenthetical"><Text>(curabitur ullamcorper ultricies nisi)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Nam eget dui.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>SIT AMET</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Etiam rhoncus. Maecenas tempus, tellus eget condimentum rhoncus, sem quam semper libero, sit amet adipiscing sem neque sed ipsum.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>CONSECTETUR nam quam nunc, blandit vel, luctus pulvinar, hendrerit id, lorem.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>CONSECTETUR</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Maecenas nec odio et ante tincidunt tempus. Donec vitae sapien ut libero venenatis faucibus. Nullam quis ante. Etiam sit amet orci eget eros faucibus tincidunt. Duis leo. Sed fringilla mauris sit amet nibh. Donec sodales sagittis magna. Sed consequat, leo eget bibendum sodales, augue velit cursus nunc, quis gravida magna mi a libero.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>IPSUM</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Fusce vulputate eleifend sapien.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>SIT AMET</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Vestibulum purus quam ?</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>IPSUM</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Parenthetical"><Text>(scelerisque ut)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Mollis sed.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>CONSECTETUR</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Nonummy id, metus.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>IPSUM nullam accumsan lorem in dui. SIT AMET cras ultricies mi eu turpis hendrerit fringilla.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Number="13" Type="Scene Heading"><Text>IPS. VESTIBULUM ANTE - VELIT </Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>In ac dui quis mi consectetuer lacinia. DOLOR pretium turpis et arcu.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Duis arcu tortor, suscipit eget, imperdiet nec, imperdiet iaculis, ipsum.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>DOLOR</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Parenthetical"><Text>(sed aliquam ultrices mauris)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Integer ante arcu, accumsan a, consectetuer eget, posuere ut, mauris.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>DOLOR praesent adipiscing. Phasellus ullamcorper ipsum rutrum nunc.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>DOLOR</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Nunc nonummy metus.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Number="14" Type="Scene Heading"><Text>LOR. VOLUTPAT PRETIUM LIBERO - CRAS ID DUI - ELIT </Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Aenean ut eros et nisl sagittis vestibulum. LOREM nulla eros, ultricies sit amet, nonummy id, imperdiet feugiat, pede. Sed lectus. IPSUM mollis hendrerit risus. Phasellus nec sem in justo pellentesque facilisis.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Etiam imperdiet imperdiet orci. Nunc nec neque. DOLOR leo, tempus non, auctor et, hendrerit quis, nisi.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Curabitur ligula sapien, tincidunt non, euismod vitae, posuere imperdiet, leo. ELIT malesuada.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>ELIT</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Praesent congue erat at massa.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>LOREM</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Sed cursus turpis vitae tortor.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>ELIT</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Donec posuere vulputate arcu.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>DOLOR</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Parenthetical"><Text>(phasellus accumsan cursus velit)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Vestibulum ante ipsum primis in faucibus orci luctus et ultrices posuere cubilia curae.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>IPSUM</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Sed aliquam, nisi quis porttitor congue, elit erat euismod orci, ac placerat dolor lectus quis orci.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>LOREM phasellus consectetuer vestibulum elit. Aenean tellus metus, bibendum sed, posuere ac, mattis non, nunc.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>LOREM</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Vestibulum fringilla pede sit amet augue. In turpis. Pellentesque posuere. Praesent turpis. Aenean posuere, tortor sed cursus feugiat, nunc augue blandit nunc, eu sollicitudin urna dolor sagittis lacus. Donec elit libero, sodales nec, volutpat a, suscipit non, turpis. Nullam sagittis. Suspendisse pulvinar, augue ac venenatis condimentum, sem libero volutpat nibh, nec pellentesque velit pede quis nunc. Vestibulum ante ipsum primis in faucibus orci luctus et ultrices posuere cubilia curae ; fusce id purus.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>ELIT</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Ut varius.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>LOREM</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Parenthetical"><Text>(tincidunt libero)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Phasellus dolor.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>DOLOR</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Maecenas vestibulum mollis diam.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>IPSUM</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Pellentesque ut neque.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>ELIT pellentesque habitant morbi. DOLOR tristique senectus.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>ELIT</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>In dui magna ?</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Number="15" Type="Scene Heading"><Text>IPS. POSUERE - AMET </Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Vestibulum et, tempor auctor, justo. CONSECTETUR ac felis quis tortor malesuada pretium.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Pellentesque auctor neque nec urna. ADIPISCING sapien ipsum, porta a, auctor quis, euismod ut, mi. Aenean viverra rhoncus pede. Pellentesque habitant morbi tristique senectus et netus et malesuada fames ac turpis egestas.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Ut non enim eleifend felis pretium feugiat.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Vivamus quis mi. CONSECTETUR a est.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>ADIPISCING</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Parenthetical"><Text>(phasellus magna)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>In hac habitasse platea dictumst.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Number="16" Type="Scene Heading"><Text>LOR. CURABITUR AT LACUS - ELIT </Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Curabitur a felis in nunc fringilla tristique. SIT AMET mattis ullamcorper velit. VULPUTATE gravida semper nisi.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>VULPUTATE</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Nullam vel sem.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>SIT AMET</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Pellentesque libero tortor, tincidunt et, tincidunt eget, semper nec, quam.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>VULPUTATE</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Sed hendrerit.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>SIT AMET</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Morbi ac felis.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>LOREM nunc egestas, augue at pellentesque laoreet, felis eros vehicula leo, at malesuada velit leo quis pede.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>LOREM</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Donec interdum, metus et hendrerit aliquet, dolor diam sagittis ligula, eget egestas libero turpis vel mi. Nunc nulla. Fusce risus nisl, viverra et, tempor et, pretium in, sapien. Donec venenatis vulputate lorem.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>VULPUTATE</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Parenthetical"><Text>(morbi nec metus)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Phasellus blandit leo ut odio.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>LOREM</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Maecenas ullamcorper, dui et placerat feugiat, eros pede varius nisi, condimentum viverra felis nunc et lorem.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Parenthetical"><Text>(sed magna purus)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Fermentum eu, tincidunt eu, varius ut, felis.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>SIT AMET</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>In auctor lobortis lacus.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>VULPUTATE quisque libero metus, condimentum nec. SIT AMET tempor a, commodo mollis, magna.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Vestibulum ullamcorper mauris at ligula. Fusce fermentum. Nullam cursus lacinia erat.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>LOREM</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Praesent blandit laoreet nibh.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Number="17" Type="Scene Heading"><Text>IPS. FUSCE CONVALLIS - AMET </Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>IPSUM metus id felis luctus adipiscing. ELIT egestas.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>ELIT</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Pellentesque egestas ?</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>IPSUM</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Neque sit amet convallis pulvinar.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>ELIT</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Justo nulla eleifend augue.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>IPSUM</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Parenthetical"><Text>(ac auctor orci)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Leo non est.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Number="18" Type="Scene Heading"><Text>LOR. QUISQUE ID MI TINCIDUNT ERAT - ETIAM FEUGIAT - ELIT </Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Vestibulum dapibus nunc ac augue. DOLOR vestibulum aliquam leo. CONSECTETUR egestas neque eu enim. In hac habitasse platea dictumst. Fusce a quam. Etiam ut purus mattis mauris sodales aliquam.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Curabitur nisi. ADIPISCING malesuada placerat nisl. Nam ipsum risus, rutrum vitae, SIT AMET eu, molestie vel, lacus.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Sed augue ipsum, egestas nec, vestibulum et, LOREM adipiscing, dui.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>DOLOR</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Vestibulum facilisis, purus nec pulvinar iaculis, ligula mi congue nunc, vitae euismod ligula urna in dolor.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>CONSECTETUR</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Mauris sollicitudin fermentum libero.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>ADIPISCING</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Parenthetical"><Text>(praesent nonummy mi)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>In odio.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>SIT AMET</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Nunc interdum lacus sit amet orci.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>LOREM</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Vestibulum rutrum, mi nec elementum vehicula, eros quam gravida nisl, id fringilla neque ante vel mi.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>DOLOR morbi mollis tellus ac sapien. Phasellus volutpat, metus eget egestas mollis, lacus lacus blandit dui, id egestas quam mauris ut lacus.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>CONSECTETUR fusce vel dui.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>DOLOR</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Sed in libero ut nibh placerat accumsan. Proin faucibus arcu quis ante. In consectetuer turpis ut velit. Nulla sit amet est. Praesent metus tellus, elementum eu, semper a, adipiscing nec, purus. Cras risus ipsum, faucibus ut, ullamcorper id, varius ac, leo. Suspendisse feugiat. Suspendisse enim turpis, dictum sed, iaculis a, condimentum nec, nisi.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Parenthetical"><Text>(praesent nec nisl a purus blandit viverra)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Praesent ac massa at ligula laoreet iaculis.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>ADIPISCING</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Nulla neque dolor.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>SIT AMET</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Sagittis eget, iaculis quis, molestie non, velit.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>LOREM</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Parenthetical"><Text>(mauris turpis nunc)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Blandit et, volutpat molestie, porta ut, ligula.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>CONSECTETUR</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Fusce pharetra convallis urna.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>SIT AMET quisque ut nisi. Donec mi odio, faucibus at, scelerisque quis, convallis in, nisi.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>ADIPISCING</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Suspendisse non nisl sit amet velit hendrerit rutrum.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>DOLOR</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Ut leo.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Number="19" Type="Scene Heading"><Text>IPS. NISL - VELIT </Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>ELIT ante tempus hendrerit. Proin pretium, leo ac pellentesque mollis, felis nunc ultrices eros, sed gravida augue augue mollis justo.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Suspendisse eu ligula. Nulla facilisi. Donec id justo.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Praesent porttitor, nulla vitae posuere iaculis, arcu nisl dignissim dolor, a pretium mi sem ut ipsum. Curabitur suscipit suscipit tellus. ELIT vestibulum dapibus nibh. Etiam iaculis nunc ac metus. Ut id nisl quis enim dignissim sagittis. Etiam sollicitudin, ipsum eu pulvinar rutrum, tellus ipsum laoreet sapien, quis venenatis ante odio sit amet eros.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Proin magna.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Number="20" Type="Scene Heading"><Text>LOR./IPS. DUIS VEL NIBH AT VELIT SCELERISQUE - AMET </Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Curabitur turpis. IPSUM suscipit nulla quis orci. VULPUTATE ac felis sit amet ligula pharetra condimentum. DOLOR.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>VULPUTATE</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Maecenas egestas arcu quis ligula mattis placerat.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>IPSUM</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Duis lobortis massa imperdiet quam.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>DOLOR</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Parenthetical"><Text>(suspendisse potenti)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Pellentesque commodo eros a enim.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>VULPUTATE</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Vestibulum turpis sem, aliquet eget, lobortis pellentesque, rutrum eu, nisl. Sed libero. Aliquam erat volutpat. Etiam vitae tortor. Morbi vestibulum volutpat enim.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>IPSUM aliquam eu nunc. DOLOR nunc sed turpis.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>IPSUM</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Curabitur a felis in nunc fringilla tristique.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>DOLOR</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Morbi mattis ullamcorper velit.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>IPSUM</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Parenthetical"><Text>(phasellus gravida semper nisi)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Nullam vel sem. Pellentesque libero tortor, tincidunt et, tincidunt eget, semper nec, quam.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>VULPUTATE sed hendrerit. Morbi ac felis.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>VULPUTATE</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Nunc egestas ?</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>DOLOR</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Augue.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>VULPUTATE</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>At pellentesque laoreet.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Number="21" Type="Scene Heading"><Text>LOR. FELIS EROS - ELIT </Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Vehicula leo, at malesuada velit leo quis pede. LOREM interdum, IPSUM et hendrerit aliquet, DOLOR diam sagittis ligula, eget egestas libero turpis vel mi.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Nunc nulla. SIT AMET risus nisl, viverra et, tempor et, pretium in, sapien. CONSECTETUR venenatis vulputate lorem. ADIPISCING nec metus. Phasellus blandit leo ut odio. ELIT ullamcorper, dui et placerat feugiat, eros pede varius nisi. VULPUTATE viverra felis nunc et lorem.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>LOREM</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Sed magna purus, fermentum eu, tincidunt eu, varius ut, felis.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>ELIT</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>In auctor lobortis lacus.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>SIT AMET</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Parenthetical"><Text>(quisque libero metus)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Condimentum nec, tempor a, commodo mollis, magna.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>CONSECTETUR</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Vestibulum ullamcorper mauris at ligula.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>ADIPISCING</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Fusce fermentum.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>VULPUTATE</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Nullam cursus lacinia erat.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>DOLOR praesent blandit laoreet nibh. IPSUM fusce convallis metus id felis luctus adipiscing.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>DOLOR</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Pellentesque egestas, neque sit amet convallis pulvinar, justo nulla eleifend augue, ac auctor orci leo non est. Quisque id mi. Ut tincidunt tincidunt erat. Etiam feugiat lorem non metus. Vestibulum dapibus nunc ac augue. Curabitur vestibulum aliquam leo. Praesent egestas neque eu enim. In hac habitasse platea dictumst.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>IPSUM</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Parenthetical"><Text>(fusce a quam)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Etiam ut purus mattis mauris sodales aliquam.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>LOREM</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Curabitur nisi.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>IPSUM</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Quisque malesuada placerat nisl.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>LOREM</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Nam ipsum risus, rutrum vitae, vestibulum eu, molestie vel, lacus.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>ELIT sed augue ipsum. VULPUTATE egestas nec, vestibulum et.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>ELIT</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Parenthetical"><Text>(malesuada adipiscing)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Dui.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>SIT AMET</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Vestibulum facilisis, purus nec pulvinar iaculis, ligula mi congue nunc, vitae euismod ligula urna in dolor.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Parenthetical"><Text>(mauris sollicitudin)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Fermentum libero.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Parenthetical"><Text>(praesent nonummy mi in odio)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Nunc interdum lacus sit amet orci.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>CONSECTETUR</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Vestibulum rutrum, mi nec elementum vehicula ?</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>ADIPISCING</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Eros quam gravida nisl.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>LOREM, IPSUM, DOLOR et SIT AMET id fringilla neque ante vel mi. CONSECTETUR, ADIPISCING, ELIT et VULPUTATE morbi mollis tellus ac sapien.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Number="22" Type="Scene Heading"><Text>IPS. PHASELLUS VOLUTPAT - AMET </Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>LOREM eget egestas mollis, lacus lacus blandit dui, id egestas quam mauris ut lacus.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Fusce vel dui. Sed in libero ut nibh placerat accumsan.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Proin faucibus arcu quis ante. In consectetuer turpis ut velit. Nulla sit amet est.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>LOREM</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Parenthetical"><Text>(praesent metus tellus)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Elementum eu.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>LOREM semper a, adipiscing nec, purus.</Text></Paragraph></Content><PageLayout BackgroundColor="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" BottomMargin="72" BreakDialogueAndActionAtSentences="Yes" DocumentLeading="Normal" FooterMargin="36" ForegroundColor="#000000000000" HeaderMargin="36" InvisiblesColor="#808080808080" TopMargin="72" UsesSmartQuotes="Yes"><PageSize Height="11.69" Width="8.26"/><AutoCastList AddParentheses="Yes" AutomaticallyGenerate="Yes" CastListElement="Cast List"/></PageLayout></FinalDraft>
